    "body": "As telemetry is opt-out inform the user about data collection on every run and provide a configuration to turn the warning off for e.g.\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ gauge run specs\r\nINFO: This installation of Gauge automatically sends telemetry data. \r\nTo turn this warning off opt-in or opt out. For more information read https://manpage.gauge.org/gauge_telemetry.html\r\n```\r\n\r\nTo hide this warning.\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ gauge telemetry on\r\n```\r\n\r\nor \r\n\r\n```\r\n$ gauge telemetry off\r\n```\r\n\r\nor set the environment variable `GAUGE_TELEMETRY_ENABLED`",
